* 19 Oct 26 dm  Finish 2 (verifier): the header says NETWAIT seconds to connect where it still said 5 (comment only).  sandbox-net.py section timeouts now times it.
* 19 Oct 26 dm  K8d: the connection waits NETWAIT seconds (sd.conf, 5 by default).
* 17 Oct 26 dm  S.65 slice 2b: written.  The person's login on a server SDSYS has defined: the SCRAM exchange is run once against the
